      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johnstown%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2009 the Heritage Discovery Center opened the Johnstown Children’s Museum and premiered “The Mystery of Steel,” a film about local steel history.",
